          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/7/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "MAKUHITA has a tireless spirit - it will never give up hope. It eats a lot of food, gets plenty of sleep, and it trains very rigorously. By living that way, this POKéMON packs its body with energy.",
