        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Makuhita est tenace. Même s’il est presque battu, il continue à se relever et à attaquer son ennemi. Chaque fois qu’il se relève, ce Pokémon stocke plus d’énergie en vue de sa future évolution.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Makuhita is tenacious—it will keep getting up and attacking its foe however many times it is knocked down. Every time it gets back up, this Pokémon stores more energy in its body for evolving.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "何回　倒されても　あきらめず　立ちあがる。 立ちあがる度　進化するための　エネルギーが 体の　中に　どんどん　蓄えられていく。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Makuhita a un moral d’acier. Il ne désespère jamais. Il mange beaucoup, dort beaucoup et s’entraîne avec rigueur. Son hygiène de vie permet à ce Pokémon d’accumuler un maximum d’énergie.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Makuhita has a tireless spirit—it will never give up hope. It eats a lot of food, gets plenty of sleep, and it trains very rigorously. By living that way, this Pokémon packs its body with energy.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "絶対に　あきらめない　根性を　持つ。 沢山　食べ　よく　寝て　運動する　ことで 体の　中に　エネルギーが　充満する。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les Makuhita d’Alola sont aujourd’hui les plus connus, bien qu’ils aient à l’origine été amenés sur l’archipel depuis des régions étrangères.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It was originally brought in from another region, but now Makuhita from Alola are more famous.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "元々は　他の　地方から 連れてこられたが　今は　アローラの マクノシタの　ほうが　有名。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "La journée de ce Pokémon est placée sous le signe de l’entraînement intensif, qui ne s’interrompt que pour manger et faire la sieste.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Their daily routine consists of training together first thing in the morning, eating and napping in the afternoon, and then more training afterward.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "朝　目覚めると　皆で　けいこ。 昼に　なると　餌を　食べ　昼寝。 目覚めれば　また　けいこの　毎日。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il s’entraîne en frappant les arbres de la paume de la main. Il peut arriver qu’il s’attaque à un pauvre Noadkoko, qui l’envoie alors valser.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It practices its slaps by repeatedly slapping tree trunks. It has been known to slap an Exeggutor and get flung away.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "木の　幹に　向かって　張り手を 繰り返し　稽古する。　ナッシーに 張り手して　投げ飛ばされることも。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il existerait un plat mijoté traditionnel que les Dresseurs cuisinent pour rendre leur Makuhita encore plus fort.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
